    {
      "number": 1,
      "stem": "Your shoes are wet. Please ____ your shoes before you go into the room.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "put on"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "take off"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "wake up"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "进屋前脱下湿鞋，take off恰当；put on是穿上，与脱鞋方向相反；wake up指唤醒，不表达鞋的穿脱。"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "stem": "The music lesson begins ____ nine o'clock ____ Monday.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "at, on"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "on, at"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "in, on"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "具体钟点用at，星期用on，A两处同时符合。B把二者次序颠倒；C把钟点用in。两空合为一次选答。"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "stem": "I am Amy. I have one sister, Eva. This bag belongs to Eva, not to me. It is ____, not ____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "her, mine"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "hers, my"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "hers, mine"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "Eva是女性且已明示所有人；独立所有格用hers，not后无名词用mine。A的her和B的my都需要后接名词，不能独立表示此处所属。两空一响应，不靠猜人物。"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "stem": "Last Saturday, we ____ paper boats at home.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "make"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "made"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "making"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "Last Saturday明确过去，made是make过去式。A原形不合该过去时间；C非限定形式且缺助动词。"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "stem": "—Would you like some orange juice?\n—____. I am thirsty.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Yes, please"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "Happy New Year"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Good night"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "A接受饮料且与口渴相符；B新年祝福、C晚安均不回应饮料邀请。只比较所给候选中的最佳应答。"
    }
  ],
